PARSFILE
#FullDataName Vehicle: Assembly`D-Class, Sedan 2017 (PT Mounts, FF Based AWD)`D-Class
#VehCode E_Ind_Ind
#CheckBox0 0    
#CheckBox1 0    

#RingCtrl0 3
OPT_PT 3
#RingCtrl1 1
#RingCtrl2 1
#RingCtrl3 0

* Front components
iaxle 1
symbol_push  <<axle>> 1
PARSFILE Suspensions\Kin_Indy\KinInd_72c84268-e5ff-4653-93e4-64cc9c37e17d.par
