PARSFILE Tires\Tire\Tire_226ce359-1dc5-472f-9e34-ec3debbea095.par
#BlueLink999 Tire`215/55 R17` Touring Tires` , Tire`Tire_226ce359-1dc5-472f-9e34-ec3debbea095

